アタシに集まってくるんだから、\nこんな幸運、他にないでしょ♪","welcome":"雷霆神あらため、サンダーバード娘のヴァイジャヤンタよ。\nどう？　世界で一番豪華で可愛いコスプレ姿でしょ。\nそれじゃ、善見城にも見せに行こっと。","raw":{"CardID":3058,"ClassID":99233,"DedicatedWeaponID":99233,"Rarity":7,"Tokusei1":20,"VoiceID":1022,"AreaType":13,"FavoriteThings":1,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":110,"AttackCorrection":144,"DefenseCorrection":106,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":1,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":93058,"OrganizedAbilityID":3058,"GeneralAbilityID1":100042,"BeforeAttackAbilityID":120002,"GimmickID":3058,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":5,"Renovation1AbilityID":94058,"Renovation1GimmickID":4058,"ExclusionVote":1,"DependenceCardId":16058,"AutoProtect":1,"Sequence":210}}